Package: test2infeR
Type: Package
Title: R Interface to Gridded Julia HMM Diagnostic Inference
Version: 0.3.0
Authors@R: person("Badger", "Diagnostics", email = "no-reply@example.org",
    role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: R interface to a Julia-based gridded Hidden Markov Model (HMM)
    inference engine for diagnostic testing data. Supports MAP, MLE, and NUTS,
    configurable year-effect processes, assay-panel masking, and fixed or
    inferred Se/Sp with Table-1 priors by default. The package can install
    Julia and instantiate a pinned Julia project automatically.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
RoxygenNote: 7.3.2
Imports:
    JuliaCall,
    stats
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
